{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-a9245419f88c7975f9a8","statement":"Let $X=\\cup_{i=1}^m X_i$ be the decomposition of $X$ into connected components, and $P=P(\\dot{\\S}, X)$. The Borel subalgebra $\\cB_P$ is solvable if and only if either $X=\\emptyset$, or $|X_i|=1$ for $i=1,\\ldots, m$, in which case the only root of $X_i$ must be isotropic.","source_id":"arXiv:1804.02563","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"8bd2d7a68ea3de5c720b5b2dde9cbd8718f4d7baa441b9fb2ec823fcae5ca085","kind":"proposition","label":"Proposition 18","ref_key":"","name":"","order":17,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02563","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"e37835a9f6b4274c653d65dc7a6ff66cac496d5a54d71d1e3faf4b1bf01adf27","line":768,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:16:48+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":271,"math_hints":30}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:1804.02563","title":"Highest weight modules for affine Lie superalgebras","abstract":"We describe Borel and parabolic subalgebras of affine Lie superalgebras and study the Verma type modules associated to such subalgebras. We give necessary and sufficient conditions under which these modules are simple.","authors":["Lucas Calixto","Vyacheslav Futorny"],"year":"2018","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.02563","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"C":"\\mathbb{C}","Z":"\\mathbb{Z}","st":"\\mathrm{st}","nat":"\\mathrm{nat}","g":"\\mathfrak{g}","fm":"\\mathfrak{m}","fh":"\\mathfrak{h}","fn":"\\mathfrak{n}","fb":"\\mathfrak{b}","fsl":"\\mathfrak{sl}","fpsl":"\\mathfrak{psl}","fosp":"\\mathfrak{osp}","fgl":"\\mathfrak{gl}","fu":"\\mathfrak{u}","fk":"\\mathfrak{k}","fH":"\\mathfrak{H}","D":"\\Delta","S":"\\Sigma","cA":"\\mathcal{A}","cB":"\\mathcal{B}","cG":"\\mathcal{G}","cH":"\\mathcal{H}","cK":"\\mathcal{K}"